-#
  Little Green Light link for one address; shown only when LGL is enabled.
  An unlinked address gets its "Link to LGL" button here; a linked one gets
  "Re-sync with LGL" beside the value on its LGL ID tag row (address_tags/_tags).
:ruby
  lgl_id = address.lgl_id
  lgl_url = Lgl.constituent_url(lgl_id)
.lgl-status
  %b LGL:
  - if lgl_url
    = link_to lgl_id, lgl_url, target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener'
  - elsif lgl_id.present?
    = lgl_id
  - else
    not linked
  - if lgl_id.blank? && can?(:lgl_sync, address)
    = button_to 'Link to LGL', lgl_sync_admin_address_path(address), method: :post, class: 'tiny button'
